WEBVTT

00:00:02.483 --> 00:00:07.258
What should I say you just tell Me -
I really don't know what to say.

00:00:07.641 --> 00:00:10.600
I keep on speaking/telling everything.

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:15.825
Yes tell what, what do you want to know? Annh?

00:00:16.475 --> 00:00:20.208
Do's and don'ts.

00:00:21.058 --> 00:00:25.600
Actually, right now mostly the people sitting here
are Sahaja Yogis, those who have attained it

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:28.550
and there are a few who haven't obtained it.

00:00:28.701 --> 00:00:33.209
So, he is speaking about what those who
have attained it should do.

00:00:33.542 --> 00:00:39.042
The most important thing is that Sahaja Yoga
is neither a lecture nor brainwashing – nothing
(of that sort).

00:00:39.734 --> 00:00:44.842
This is what is called actualization, that is
taking place, a happening, it's that thing.

00:00:45.442 --> 00:00:50.475
And the event should happen because your
attention is outside.

00:00:52.067 --> 00:00:57.717
You are listening to My discourse, and if I say
that you should take your attention inside, then
you cannot take it inside.

00:01:00.250 --> 00:01:05.392
If you are told to direct your attention towards
your Spirit, you might ask, "Where is the Spirit,
and where should I direct my attention?"

00:01:06.525 --> 00:01:11.226
There is just one way for this: an event must
take place inside.

00:01:11.359 --> 00:01:14.851
It is just due to the occurrence of that happening that
the attention will turn inward.

00:01:21.893 --> 00:01:25.401
I'm telling them about the

00:01:28.201 --> 00:01:31.201
way Sahaja Yoga is. It is not

00:01:31.476 --> 00:01:34.718
the talking about it

00:01:35.251 --> 00:01:40.468
or giving a lecture or a brainwash that is
going to help but

00:01:40.626 --> 00:01:44.935
the actualization, the happening that is going
to take place within you.

00:01:46.168 --> 00:01:50.302
Now why, people ask Me, why this Kundalini
was kept like that there

00:01:50.419 --> 00:01:55.202
and then it had to rise and that people had to seek it?

00:01:56.952 --> 00:02:01.335
First of all, as I said that Kundalini is the
residual consciousness within us,

00:02:01.960 --> 00:02:06.402
is recording all that we have done

00:02:06.494 --> 00:02:09.685
before in many lives and today whatever we are doing.

00:02:10.643 --> 00:02:16.218
It is the subconscious, which is like a tape-recorder,

00:02:17.143 --> 00:02:20.593
the complete micro-subconscious you can call it,

00:02:20.718 --> 00:02:23.151
which is placed in the triangular bone.

00:02:26.501 --> 00:02:29.501
Now why, this happening is necessary

00:02:29.934 --> 00:02:35.476
because the attention that is outside of
human-beings, have to be pulled inside.

00:02:36.043 --> 00:02:41.359
Now, how is it possible to attract the
attention inside?

00:02:42.151 --> 00:02:45.451
Say something happens, say a tree falls down.

00:02:46.209 --> 00:02:48.034
You are listening to Me

00:02:48.217 --> 00:02:52.742
with complete concentration, but the tree falls
down, you all will pay attention to that.

00:02:52.909 --> 00:02:56.884
Because there's a happening which attracts
your attention.

00:02:57.159 --> 00:03:00.834
That's why, Kundalini rising was necessary.

00:03:03.309 --> 00:03:05.784
If Kundalini was just placed

00:03:06.017 --> 00:03:10.751
in a way like all our nerves are, there would
have been no happening.

00:03:11.901 --> 00:03:17.018
To create the happening within us,

00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:22.535
the Kundalini was placed in such a fashion
in a three and a half coil.

00:03:23.260 --> 00:03:29.402
So the happening takes place and automatically
our attention is attracted inside

00:03:30.452 --> 00:03:34.952
because you know, Sahaja Yoga is a spontaneous happening.

00:03:34.952 --> 00:03:37.660
It happens spontaneously.

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:41.960
You cannot take your attention inside whatever
you may try.

00:03:42.085 --> 00:03:45.085
You think, you are deluded

00:03:46.868 --> 00:03:52.243
in thinking that you are doing something
about your evolution.

00:03:53.893 --> 00:03:58.543
So, we come to the point, 'What should we do
after realization?'

00:03:59.626 --> 00:04:03.835
Before realization, you don't have to do
anything whatsoever

00:04:04.118 --> 00:04:07.043
because you cannot do. It is something like,

00:04:07.276 --> 00:04:12.735
this machine has not yet started, or your
car has not yet started.

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:17.660
When the car has not started, then,

00:04:17.818 --> 00:04:21.693
how do you move about; what's the use of
moving the steering?

00:04:21.835 --> 00:04:27.260
What's the use of moving the brake or clutches?
It makes no difference.

00:04:27.518 --> 00:04:33.301
So, doing anything before Self-realization,
has no meaning, has no meaning.

00:04:36.943 --> 00:04:41.809
Now don't pay attention to every small happening
anybody is coming in and all that; That's a
bit too much - annh?

00:04:41.959 --> 00:04:44.742
Pay attention.

00:04:50.467 --> 00:04:53.300
So, before realization

00:04:53.408 --> 00:04:58.383
people think, 'We should do some sort of a
japa, tapa and all these things.'

00:04:59.042 --> 00:05:00.842
This is all artificial.

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:05.350
When your machine has not yet started,
why should you do it?

00:05:07.533 --> 00:05:12.692
Without knowing your Atma or Spirit, you
cannot know anything about God.

00:05:12.867 --> 00:05:16.100
and whatever you try to do, could be absolutely wrong

00:05:16.417 --> 00:05:20.058
because you don't have the eyes to see. That's why,

00:05:20.258 --> 00:05:24.417
all these people who claim to be religious,
have landed in difficulty.

00:05:26.692 --> 00:05:32.825
Once you are connected with God, you enter
into the Kingdom of God,

00:05:33.042 --> 00:05:36.467
then you are looked after and then you have a right

00:05:36.825 --> 00:05:42.517
to use your powers as a citizen of that Kingdom.

00:05:49.709 --> 00:05:55.051
But before that, if you try to do any such effort

00:05:55.601 --> 00:05:58.201
it is all futile.

00:05:58.401 --> 00:06:03.851
Like a telephone being used, which is not
connected to the mains - it's like a toy.

00:06:05.201 --> 00:06:09.251
It's a dummy. Till you are realized, you are a dummy.

00:06:09.701 --> 00:06:13.068
You must get your realization and for that

00:06:13.135 --> 00:06:16.660
God has already made arrangements in you -
why are you worrying?

00:06:18.752 --> 00:06:23.751
As I have said again and again, you have become
a human-being from a amoeba

00:06:23.852 --> 00:06:26.585
without doing any effort; Who has done it?

00:06:28.335 --> 00:06:34.160
A seed sprouts. Do you stand on your head for
the seed or does the seed stand on it's own?

00:06:35.177 --> 00:06:39.860
This is a living process. The whole evolution
is a living process

00:06:39.927 --> 00:06:43.743
It has to be worked out by God Almighty Himself.

00:06:45.393 --> 00:06:46.918
You cannot do it.

00:06:49.260 --> 00:06:53.401
Once you know that you cannot do it, then
you will realize

00:06:53.651 --> 00:06:59.209
that all the efforts you have put in, might
have even spoiled your Kundalini channel.

00:07:01.042 --> 00:07:04.717
It has gone to such absurd limits of deliberation,

00:07:06.575 --> 00:07:09.975
sometimes I do feel like laughing but  mostly I weep.

00:07:11.167 --> 00:07:14.383
Even like Rajyog and all that people talk of

00:07:15.233 --> 00:07:21.191
actually, these things happen within yourself
when the machinery starts moving.

00:07:22.291 --> 00:07:24.183
You see it would be something,

00:07:24.883 --> 00:07:30.700
like a car when it moves, the wheel also moves
automatically - you don't have to move the wheel.

00:07:31.125 --> 00:07:35.108
But before starting the car if you start
moving the wheel, will the car move?

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:39.325
It is something like that you have done.

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:44.733
Artificially you have moved the wheel, you
have moved everything,

00:07:45.016 --> 00:07:48.708
taken so much labour and if you have to
move the wheel, imagine

00:07:48.875 --> 00:07:52.816
without starting the car, how much effort
you have to put in?

00:07:53.774 --> 00:07:57.625
You are exhausting your energy, you are
spoiling the wheel

00:07:57.692 --> 00:08:00.833
and you do not even budge out an inch.

00:08:03.216 --> 00:08:05.341
It is as simple as that

00:08:05.616 --> 00:08:09.666
but when I say it has to be effortless, people
say, "What about purusharth?"

00:08:11.558 --> 00:08:17.974
Is all egoistic act. Purusharth is in maintaining
yourself all right.

00:08:18.441 --> 00:08:27.407
Like Kabir has said, [Servant Kabir wrapped the
sheet around himself with utmost care, and kept
the sheet exactly as it was.]

00:08:29.565 --> 00:08:35.140
That you do not do. You'll go to a guru,
pay him money, run after him,

00:08:35.232 --> 00:08:40.649
and do all kinds of things for a guru, but
you will not improve your moral life.

00:08:42.324 --> 00:08:44.558
You'll drink, you'll have women, you'll have

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:48.850
all kinds of self-destroying elements working
and here you'll be going to guru.

00:08:52.167 --> 00:08:56.533
You must have your dharma intact. This is
the purusharth,

00:08:57.175 --> 00:09:02.507
is to keep you yourself away from all kinds
of nonsensical temptations

00:09:02.741 --> 00:09:09.624
which come to you and use your freedom to maintain
your freedom from this kind of nonsensical enslavement.

00:09:11.041 --> 00:09:15.074
This is our enslavement - this is not freedom.

00:09:15.466 --> 00:09:20.424
To enjoy your lust and greed, is not freedom.

00:09:20.591 --> 00:09:24.357
the freedom lies in achieving the power

00:09:25.082 --> 00:09:28.657
to be above all these things, above all temptations.

00:09:31.074 --> 00:09:36.357
Every moment we are enslaving ourselves - there
we do not put in any effort.

00:09:36.932 --> 00:09:42.615
On the contrary, we make all effort to see that
we are completely destroyed before we come to Sahaja Yog.

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:49.798
So now, here Mataji is sitting and breaking
Her hands and breaking Her feet.

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:57.173
Children get realization in no time.

00:09:58.148 --> 00:10:01.473
They enjoy the vibrations without any difficulty.

00:10:04.765 --> 00:10:06.956
They have no problem.

00:10:09.748 --> 00:10:14.523
They are so quiet, they are enjoying the atmosphere

00:10:14.673 --> 00:10:17.890
while you have complicated yourself for nothing at all.

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:29.457
We read all kinds of nonsensical things; By
reading these things you'll reach God?

00:10:30.865 --> 00:10:36.357
What university did Christ attend? How
many books did He read?

00:10:40.007 --> 00:10:44.157
What university anyone of the saints till then -

00:10:44.365 --> 00:10:48.265
regarded as a real saint, have attended?

00:10:48.498 --> 00:10:54.907
Gyaneshwara, the great person from the South,

00:10:55.274 --> 00:10:58.274
Adishankaracharya from Kerala -

00:10:58.566 --> 00:11:01.332
anyone of them, did they attend any university?

00:11:02.732 --> 00:11:06.390
They never required, because knowledge is within.

00:11:06.648 --> 00:11:10.307
Whatever is without, is non-knowledge, Avidya.

00:11:13.282 --> 00:11:16.282
Even Surdas says, after writing Sursagar,

00:11:16.640 --> 00:11:20.649
'Dispel all of Surdas's ignorance, O Nandlal.'

00:11:21.557 --> 00:11:27.349
What is the Vidya? What is the Vidya of a motor-car?

00:11:28.641 --> 00:11:32.507
To know what switch works what instrument.

00:11:33.332 --> 00:11:36.249
to know how to control the car,

00:11:36.582 --> 00:11:41.349
to know how to drive it - that is the vidya of car.

00:11:42.132 --> 00:11:48.699
In the same way, the vidya is to know what

00:11:49.191 --> 00:11:54.982
is the key for different chakras. How to keep
your own chakras alright?

00:11:55.499 --> 00:12:00.165
How to keep the chakras of others alright?
How by these things

00:12:00.373 --> 00:12:07.148
you get the movement into your own being?
[UNCLEAR] the matter.

00:12:08.865 --> 00:12:14.606
I don't think I need it. [MARATHI] it's quite a lot.

00:12:16.339 --> 00:12:22.998
There is no need at all for you to know the
key before starting the car.

00:12:23.798 --> 00:12:26.798
After starting the car, you can see for yourself

00:12:27.006 --> 00:12:31.481
if this works? If you put on this switch
does the light comes in?

00:12:33.631 --> 00:12:39.506
If you are not able to start the car, what's
the use of knowing the key also?

00:12:40.139 --> 00:12:43.314
But surprisingly, nobody knows the key.

00:12:44.597 --> 00:12:46.722
They are so silly, if I tell you

00:12:47.489 --> 00:12:50.914
you'll be amazed to know how they work it out.

00:12:52.272 --> 00:12:57.414
Now, you get a car which is stranded, which
is not moving at all.

00:12:57.522 --> 00:13:00.731
You are a novice person.

00:13:01.156 --> 00:13:05.048
You have never seen a car, alright - so
the car comes to you.

00:13:06.006 --> 00:13:09.923
So they say, 'Alright, you take one name - Rama's name.'

00:13:10.048 --> 00:13:13.048
You don't know where does this deity lie?

00:13:15.631 --> 00:13:18.473
Whether you have to put on that one or not?

00:13:19.340 --> 00:13:21.715
Whether you have to use that name or not?

00:13:21.806 --> 00:13:26.265
Whether you are endowed with the right to use
that name or not?

00:13:27.715 --> 00:13:33.390
You say, 'Alright, I will take the name.' So
you start taking out the hood of the car.

00:13:36.232 --> 00:13:43.840
It is that foolish, it is that absurd, it is that stupid.

00:13:47.707 --> 00:13:52.098
Vidya is to know all the key of your being,

00:13:53.648 --> 00:13:56.648
to know about yourself and about others

00:13:57.581 --> 00:14:01.140
and to know how to work out these things

00:14:01.248 --> 00:14:04.673
of this mechanism - the tantra of Kundalini.

00:14:05.248 --> 00:14:10.631
But these horrible tantrikas - they call themselves
tantrikas - they're thugs.

00:14:11.823 --> 00:14:17.048
They are not tantrikas. They do not know the
tantra. They know just the opposite of tantra.

00:14:17.131 --> 00:14:21.756
How to insult the tantra by leading a very unholy life.

00:14:22.048 --> 00:14:30.014
Holiness is the petrol of this tantra, is the light of .....

00:14:30.606 --> 00:14:36.472
Without holiness you cannot work out anything
about Kundalini and those who try their hands,

00:14:37.464 --> 00:14:41.789
get such backfire

00:14:42.714 --> 00:14:46.481
and such shocks - they describe it as Kundalini awakening.

00:14:51.164 --> 00:14:57.664
So useless and so thoroughly dangerous are
these theories of tantrikas.

00:14:59.889 --> 00:15:02.331
Throw all these theories in the sea.

00:15:04.564 --> 00:15:08.639
Sea is the only thing can take, engulf this poison.

00:15:11.039 --> 00:15:16.231
You are selling tantrism, you are selling poison.

00:15:17.606 --> 00:15:20.248
You're making money on selling poison,

00:15:21.206 --> 00:15:27.798
spoiling your Motherland, defaming your own Kundalini.

00:15:30.881 --> 00:15:35.823
So realize, that it is the work of God

00:15:36.148 --> 00:15:40.848
It is the ocean which is going to engulf
the little drop

00:15:41.015 --> 00:15:45.431
and the drop that is going to fall into the ocean.

00:15:47.489 --> 00:15:50.489
It is effortless - Sahaja.

00:15:51.247 --> 00:15:55.914
Sahaja means effortless but the word has
come from 'Saha' and 'ja'

00:15:56.056 --> 00:16:00.131
'Saha' means with, 'ja' means born - is born with you.

00:16:02.314 --> 00:16:05.773
Even using this name, I've seen -

00:16:06.048 --> 00:16:12.723
I've seen people using this name 'Sahaja'
have used all asahaja methods.

00:16:15.023 --> 00:16:17.673
[ASIDE - Give them chairs, if they want to sit.]

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:24.798
Come in the evening, in the evening.

00:16:26.390 --> 00:16:32.373
Now, what these Sahaja Yogis should do and
what they should not do .

00:16:33.065 --> 00:16:36.873
I am still not very sure

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:44.007
I am not very sure just now, if I should tell about
it because there are many who are not yet Sahaja Yogis here.

00:16:44.357 --> 00:16:46.774
So best thing is to give them realization first

00:16:46.882 --> 00:16:50.741
and then we'll discuss this with the Sahaja yogis - alright?

00:16:52.766 --> 00:16:54.891
I was telling you this morning...

00:16:57.333 --> 00:17:00.491
that your attention which is towards Me

00:17:01.458 --> 00:17:05.524
if I were to ask you to take it inwards, you
wouldn't be able to do so.

00:17:06.624 --> 00:17:07.591
and

00:17:11.408 --> 00:17:14.050
[ASIDE - Have to ask you one thing. Should
I speak in English or Hindi?]

00:17:14.183 --> 00:17:18.450
Seeker: Hindi, Hindi
Shri Mataji: All people understand English or Hindi?

00:17:20.542 --> 00:17:24.850
Seeker: As You may easily...
Shri Mataji: My child, I speak all of them.

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:29.500
What to do, have learnt English too in this life.

00:17:29.576 --> 00:17:32.492
In Hindi? Okay, will speak in Hindi.

00:17:36.925 --> 00:17:40.867
For that, some event or the other needs to
take place within; some happening.

00:17:43.075 --> 00:17:46.167
I told you this in the morning.

00:17:46.609 --> 00:17:48.809
There is one more very important point about it

00:17:50.317 --> 00:17:54.842
..that if realization of the Supreme Being and the
Spirit is attained by only one or two people...

00:17:55.192 --> 00:18:00.175
to selected people, and if the common people
remain untouched by this

00:18:01.192 --> 00:18:02.783
then it makes no sense at all.

00:18:05.375 --> 00:18:07.500
Neither will the Supreme Being hold any meaning,

00:18:08.875 --> 00:18:11.783
nor will any meaning be derived from this world.

00:18:12.483 --> 00:18:14.825
Nothing meaningful is going to come out of
this creation either.

00:18:16.075 --> 00:18:19.317
This achievement ought to be of the common people.

00:18:20.334 --> 00:18:24.159
If this is not of the general public but is
instead of a very select few...

00:18:24.884 --> 00:18:26.909
then the same thing will happen that happened
to everyone.

00:18:27.451 --> 00:18:29.992
No one ever acknowledged those who lived like this.

00:18:31.484 --> 00:18:33.884
And tell Me what happens even if you believe.

00:18:34.034 --> 00:18:39.076
Suppose someone is a great king, then he is a
king in his own house, what do we care,
we have not got anything.

00:18:40.951 --> 00:18:45.418
We should also get something, only then will it
have any meaning.

00:18:50.610 --> 00:18:54.210
Therefore, this happening must take place.

00:18:54.652 --> 00:18:59.494
Not only this, it should happen in general,
in many people, in a lot of people.

00:19:00.452 --> 00:19:05.894
I have told you that Science also works similarly,
that you come to know about electricity.

00:19:07.111 --> 00:19:13.611
The one who must have discovered - if that electricity
is not put to use for the general public, then what
is the point of it?

00:19:19.144 --> 00:19:24.619
As for the achievement of Sahaja Yoga today—
Sahaja has been going on for so many years.

00:19:24.894 --> 00:19:29.769
Ever since the universe was created, it
has been created spontaneously(sahaja).
Just as there is a seed

00:19:30.111 --> 00:19:34.002
and its sprouts remain within that seed,
everything remains within it.

00:19:34.352 --> 00:19:38.269
All the blueprints for every tree destined to
emerge from it are already contained within it.

00:19:40.102 --> 00:19:44.002
Similarly, the entire blueprint of this creation
is already laid out at a microscopic level

00:19:47.652 --> 00:19:51.102
and all of it unfolds and keeps blossoming
quite naturally.

00:19:51.610 --> 00:19:54.927
Sahaja means, 'saha' that is 'with you'

00:19:55.202 --> 00:19:59.452
And 'ja' means 'born'—this thing was born
right along with you.

00:20:05.069 --> 00:20:08.427
And just as one or two flowers appear on a tree first...

00:20:09.969 --> 00:20:12.427
But when the tree grows large and the blossom time comes

00:20:12.635 --> 00:20:15.894
then it bears numerous flowers, which then turn
into abundant fruits.

00:20:16.136 --> 00:20:20.977
In the same way, the Sahaja Yoga that is today
in our hands, in a new

00:20:22.535 --> 00:20:30.152
dimension standing, is meant for the common
person, not for the extraordinary.

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:35.735
So, first of all, you need to get the thought
out of your mind that, "How will it happen to us?"

00:20:39.143 --> 00:20:45.435
'Are we even worthy of this or not? This
happening simply cannot take place within us.'

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:50.985
If you have come here with such thoughts
already in your mind, then leave them
outside along with your shoes.

00:20:53.402 --> 00:20:57.552
This is bound to happen; this happening will take place.

00:20:57.985 --> 00:21:02.144
Even if it doesn't happen today, it will definitely
happen tomorrow, and I have to do it.

00:21:04.419 --> 00:21:10.919
And you deserve it too. Now how far can one
wander away from power?

00:21:13.519 --> 00:21:17.944
I mean, if there is the best thing and you
work on it, then what great thing have you done?

00:21:26.944 --> 00:21:31.427
So never think that this thing will never happen
to us, this is the first thing.

00:21:32.494 --> 00:21:35.710
If there is any nervousness regarding this matter,
cast it aside first.

00:21:35.952 --> 00:21:40.135
Because I will work hard, and this thing will happen.

00:21:43.635 --> 00:21:48.018
Now, the second thing is that a doubt arises:
"Mother, who is She to do this?"

00:21:50.126 --> 00:21:53.510
"And I had heard that the awakening of the
Kundalini is an extremely difficult thing,"

00:21:53.668 --> 00:21:57.077
"In that you stand on your head, it takes
thousands of years to happen."

00:21:57.685 --> 00:22:03.935
That’s what everyone says. Who knows what sort of
things they’ve written. But this is not the case with Me.

00:22:07.152 --> 00:22:10.961
It may be that I am very expert in this, I'm an artisan,

00:22:11.402 --> 00:22:15.252
I know the work, that is why till date I have never
seen on anyone,

00:22:15.344 --> 00:22:17.835
anyone saying to Me, "Mother, give me realization, and I
didn't do it."

00:22:18.177 --> 00:22:22.468
There are all kinds of problems - great permutations,
combinations.

00:22:23.393 --> 00:22:28.043
There are problems too because man has put himself
onto many wrong paths.

00:22:28.176 --> 00:22:33.110
He's not necessarily a bad person - he's a good person.

00:22:33.343 --> 00:22:36.843
But mistakes happen even in religion; one ends up
bowing before wrong places.

00:22:38.051 --> 00:22:42.226
We believe in wrong people and get confused. Now these
people are very decent, poor things,

00:22:42.593 --> 00:22:48.751
they're very decent persons, nothing wrong with them.
They just got caught up in this mess; basically,
acted a bit foolishly—that’s all.

00:22:51.334 --> 00:22:56.176
And because the powers of Satan are so intensely
active in the Kali Yuga...

00:22:56.301 --> 00:22:58.876
hard to escape from their clutches – they're
children after all.

00:23:05.259 --> 00:23:10.068
I have awakened the Kundalinis of thousands of people,
and there is no doubt that I can awaken yours as well.

00:23:11.410 --> 00:23:15.751
But if I can do it, there is no need for you
to be angry with Me for it.

00:23:17.609 --> 00:23:21.518
I mentioned just this morning that if I am skilled
enough to handle this, so I can do it.

00:23:21.618 --> 00:23:24.168
If you are the artisan for this—well, if someone
were to ask Me to fix it, I simply wouldn't be
able to do it.

00:23:24.285 --> 00:23:26.535
This means I haven't become inferior, nor
have I become superior.

00:23:27.835 --> 00:23:30.485
If you ask Me to operate this, I won't be
able to do so.

00:23:30.927 --> 00:23:33.693
You may teach it a number of times; it is
beyond My capability.

00:23:34.768 --> 00:23:39.060
That is how useless I am in this matter.

00:23:39.352 --> 00:23:45.469
But that what I know—that I know, that I do and
have done it; and it can happen within you as well.

00:23:47.569 --> 00:23:50.136
Therefore, we should sit prepared in such a way

00:23:50.803 --> 00:23:55.394
that it is going to happen, I am eligible for it
too, and this happening will take place

00:23:57.986 --> 00:24:00.986
and this is for the common man -

00:24:02.378 --> 00:24:05.378
You just need to be prepared.

00:24:07.270 --> 00:24:12.370
If there is any defect, I must point it out;
if any precautions need to be taken, I must
mention them.

00:24:12.545 --> 00:24:15.437
Or perhaps some precaution you might have messed up

00:24:15.545 --> 00:24:19.212
I have to say something about that too - people
get angry over every little thing.

00:24:20.604 --> 00:24:22.204
Humans are strange too.

00:24:22.687 --> 00:24:27.362
If I were to ask you to, "Bring Me three thousand
rupees," you wouldn't mind at all; you would bring
and hand it over immediately.

00:24:27.904 --> 00:24:31.195
But if I were to say, "Son, this is somewhat
wrong; give it up..."

00:24:31.312 --> 00:24:33.553
Then they will get very offended—they will
leave the pandal and walk away.

00:24:39.078 --> 00:24:42.078
Well, I am a Mother, after all; I do have
to tell you a thing or two.

00:24:42.228 --> 00:24:44.220
First of all, don't feel bad about it.

00:24:44.787 --> 00:24:46.895
The second point is that that you have to
establish yourself in it.

00:24:48.020 --> 00:24:52.628
Many of you have come today, some people
who came in the morning have come again.

00:24:53.853 --> 00:24:57.561
In Sahaja Yoga, one has to settle down; just as a plant

00:24:57.703 --> 00:25:01.369
has a living process, it needs to be firmly established.

00:25:01.519 --> 00:25:06.452
Just like when a seed first sprouts—everything
about it is so tender.

00:25:06.852 --> 00:25:12.544
It requires a great deal of nurturing and care.
Then, once the tree has firmly taken root,
no matter how

00:25:14.736 --> 00:25:20.269
hard the wind blows, whatever calamity strikes,
or however fierce the storm becomes, there is no fear.

00:25:22.377 --> 00:25:27.919
That is why you need to understand that once
you have achieved it, you must settle down.

00:25:29.452 --> 00:25:34.611
The third thing is that many people have become
very accustomed to listening to speeches.

00:25:34.736 --> 00:25:38.194
A gentleman had come, I think he does Guru shopping.

00:25:38.852 --> 00:25:42.744
I asked him—he used to go to all sorts of gurus;
he came to Me just like that, bag in hand.

00:25:42.902 --> 00:25:47.435
Guru shopping is going on, let's buy something
here too. So here the matter is different.

00:25:48.960 --> 00:25:50.835
Here you are not out for shopping.

00:25:51.810 --> 00:25:55.202
I am not satisfied with speeches. Speeches are fine;

00:25:55.752 --> 00:25:58.885
even through them, I am making your Kundalini dance and rise.

00:25:59.502 --> 00:26:03.093
And I will not be satisfied until you get your realization.

00:26:03.610 --> 00:26:07.110
And why are you, too, caught up in this mess?
Why don't you just get your realization?

00:26:08.860 --> 00:26:12.693
After all, it is that alone which is to be attained;
it is that alone which is to be known.

00:26:17.293 --> 00:26:22.060
But Sahaja Yoga doesn't work out because people just

00:26:22.602 --> 00:26:26.668
want to give money to Mother, do something or the
other—just get something done and be done with it.

00:26:26.743 --> 00:26:29.368
You do the same to every guru, you are not
able to give money to your Mother here.

00:26:30.018 --> 00:26:35.035
You cannot win over Mother until you have
transcended and become established in it.

00:26:35.702 --> 00:26:42.594
These are two things. People don't want to do it;
they think, "Well, this requires hard work

00:26:43.177 --> 00:26:46.769
You don't have to put in any effort while
getting realization. Not at that time.

00:26:47.294 --> 00:26:51.519
After being realized, you have to settle down
and you should settle down.

00:26:52.594 --> 00:26:56.827
The time has come. This is the call of the times.

00:26:57.135 --> 00:27:03.077
And if in response to the call of this time,
you do not

00:27:04.327 --> 00:27:07.852
awaken yourself then there will be great
difficulty later.

00:27:08.002 --> 00:27:11.002
There will be a major difficulty—I will
tell you about it.

00:27:13.319 --> 00:27:18.327
Another point is that people do not settle into
Sahaja Yoga, and subsequently, they fall ill.

00:27:19.177 --> 00:27:22.635
After that, they come to Me and say, "Mother, heal us."

00:27:25.677 --> 00:27:29.793
After coming to Sahaja Yoga, people have stopped
visiting doctors;

00:27:32.176 --> 00:27:34.851
have got their doors closed they do not go to their houses.

00:27:36.718 --> 00:27:41.768
Everything is fine in every respect, but there
is one thing, that after knowing oneself,

00:27:41.968 --> 00:27:46.251
one must delve deep within and become one
with that essence.

00:27:47.034 --> 00:27:53.443
And you have to use your full power.

00:27:56.926 --> 00:28:03.968
Sahaja Yoga is not for just anyone. Whosoever
is Mother's son, only he will get it from Mother.

00:28:06.810 --> 00:28:10.010
Let Me tell you this first—don't take offence.

00:28:13.852 --> 00:28:17.393
Tukaram has said, "This is not a task for the
incompetent or the inept."

00:28:18.276 --> 00:28:21.585
Only those who are of a certain mettle can
enter Sahaja Yoga.

00:28:25.793 --> 00:28:30.843
Now let Me tell you a little about Kundalini which I

00:28:31.009 --> 00:28:37.192
[MARATHI]

00:28:37.342 --> 00:28:42.550
[MARATHI]

00:28:42.708 --> 00:28:45.258
So now understand, that I'm here for about
five more days.

00:28:45.483 --> 00:28:49.133
I will tell you everything about Kundalini in
five days.

00:28:49.500 --> 00:28:54.508
From tomorrow, please bring some paper and pencil
as well, so you can take notes on the things I tell you.

00:29:01.758 --> 00:29:09.374
First of all you can see, right here before you

00:29:12.849 --> 00:29:16.724
is the complete mechanism that the Supreme Being
has created within us.

00:29:17.966 --> 00:29:24.049
Now, like the things we see in this world, this
mechanism is not a dead mechanism, it's a living one.

00:29:27.757 --> 00:29:31.341
And what is called Surati, is the very same Kundalini.

00:29:32.858 --> 00:29:40.083
After all, we—in human form—are functioning based
on something or other, aren't we?

00:29:41.291 --> 00:29:44.291
Look at this eye, it is such an amazing thing.

00:29:45.216 --> 00:29:48.999
How efficient and beautiful the movement of the
entire body is.

00:29:49.424 --> 00:29:54.116
How exquisitely the entire creation has been fashioned!

00:29:54.624 --> 00:29:59.833
All these things - there are some kind of powers
which are hidden.

00:30:00.583 --> 00:30:04.341
They are hidden because our gross attention...

00:30:05.399 --> 00:30:10.999
Our gross attention is unable to grasp it.
A certain subtlety is required for that.

00:30:11.349 --> 00:30:14.349
Attaining this subtlety is the very goal of Sahaja Yoga.

00:30:15.257 --> 00:30:18.257
Entering into this subtleness is the objective of Sahaja Yoga.

00:30:19.332 --> 00:30:23.290
What is known as recognizing one's true self
—recognizing the Spirit.

00:30:23.490 --> 00:30:27.798
As I told you this morning, without recognizing the Spirit

00:30:27.915 --> 00:30:31.673
your illusion can never be shattered, and you can
never know the Almighty.

00:30:32.515 --> 00:30:37.306
Whatever you know about it is merely knowledge,
not realization.

00:30:38.231 --> 00:30:40.564
Realization comes after knowing the Spirit

00:30:40.922 --> 00:30:46.014
Therefore, the Spirit must be known first and
then everything else will be understood.

00:30:47.314 --> 00:30:51.889
Now, this Kundalini that is, I'll explain this
entire mechanism.

00:30:51.939 --> 00:30:56.089
And then I will also tell you where the
Kundalini is. First of all,

00:31:03.864 --> 00:31:09.498
Look at this left-hand side here; From the right
hand side of the head

00:31:09.856 --> 00:31:13.865
the Power which passes through us and descends
along the left side,

00:31:15.132 --> 00:31:18.623
our existence is through this Power.

00:31:20.081 --> 00:31:24.965
This is a subtle energy; it is invisible to
the naked eye. It

00:31:25.732 --> 00:31:30.532
emerges from the top of the head,

00:31:32.890 --> 00:31:38.282
passes down through the spine, and descends to
the lower regions. It cannot be seen with the
physical eyes.

00:31:38.657 --> 00:31:43.749
But when realization happens, then I can
show you each power one by one.

00:31:46.166 --> 00:31:53.974
We refer to the energy channel(nadi) that carries
this energy as the 'Ida Nadi' or 'Chandra Nadi'.
In this way,

00:31:55.891 --> 00:32:00.549
when this subtle power manifests itself externally,

00:32:01.066 --> 00:32:03.516
when it is expressed, manifested,

00:32:03.691 --> 00:32:08.366
then our left sympathetic nervous system is formed
from this.

00:32:11.591 --> 00:32:17.057
It is the power of our existence and when this power

00:32:17.357 --> 00:32:20.174
sleeps off, then death occurs.

00:32:21.666 --> 00:32:30.407
That is why people also call this power the
power of destruction.

00:32:31.457 --> 00:32:35.165
In Sanskrit this Power is known as Mahakali Power.

00:32:35.532 --> 00:32:41.649
There are no words for it in English because its under currents
have not yet been explored in English as to what they are.

00:32:43.532 --> 00:32:47.524
What are the undercurrents of Sympathetic and
Parasympathetic Nervous System,

00:32:47.632 --> 00:32:49.757
haven't yet been discovered by Science.

00:32:50.582 --> 00:32:53.540
So, if I refer to this as the power of Mahakali,

00:32:53.665 --> 00:32:56.357
there is no need to be alarmed; after all,
we are not British.

00:32:59.615 --> 00:33:02.157
And the second power, which

00:33:04.965 --> 00:33:08.424
from our left hand side

00:33:09.324 --> 00:33:12.824
passes through us to the right hand side,

00:33:15.499 --> 00:33:17.982
is known as the power of Mahasaraswati.

00:33:19.415 --> 00:33:24.465
With this power we can have movement in our body

00:33:27.490 --> 00:33:32.423
perform physical activities, intellectual activities
and even mental activities.

00:33:33.398 --> 00:33:38.565
Now in medicine, people are unable to differentiate
between left and right sympathetic

00:33:39.590 --> 00:33:44.115
But these two are two different things. The left
represents your emotional side

00:33:44.257 --> 00:33:47.648
and the right side represents your mental
and physical aspect.

00:33:50.573 --> 00:33:52.873
In Medicine there is no differentiation between the two.

00:33:53.931 --> 00:33:57.690
This is the reason why people do not understand
a disease like diabetes.

00:33:57.857 --> 00:34:02.565
I will explain to you how imbalances arise.

00:34:03.307 --> 00:34:06.615
And by understanding the distinction regarding imbalance,

00:34:06.965 --> 00:34:11.107
one realizes that one nadi (energy channel) flows
more actively while the other flows less so.

00:34:11.340 --> 00:34:15.265
If one moves less, it leads to health problems,

00:34:15.465 --> 00:34:19.365
and the one which moves more, there is aggression on it.

00:34:20.840 --> 00:34:25.998
The sense of imbalance comes only when you can see
its two ends.

00:34:35.181 --> 00:34:40.490
So, the channel that carries the energy located
on the right side

00:34:40.948 --> 00:34:45.015
is known as Pingala Nadi. It is also called
as Sun Channel.

00:34:50.815 --> 00:34:55.240
This leads to the advent of the sympathetic nervous
system on the right side.

00:35:01.357 --> 00:35:05.807
In between the two what you see is a nadi.

00:35:08.874 --> 00:35:11.249
This channel is called the Sushumna Nadi.

00:35:15.999 --> 00:35:18.999
This channel, as far as it exists within us,

00:35:19.132 --> 00:35:23.407
means it manifests the Parasympathetic Nervous System.

00:35:26.257 --> 00:35:28.365
Human beings have evolved only that far.

00:35:31.615 --> 00:35:37.565
Now, whatever we have achieved to date in our evolution -

00:35:38.398 --> 00:35:44.048
from the state of an amoeba to that of a human being
—is contained within our Central Nervous System.

00:35:46.081 --> 00:35:50.898
Please understand that our Central Nervous System
is a reflector of all this.

00:35:55.748 --> 00:35:57.981
That is in our Conscious mind.

00:36:03.531 --> 00:36:08.556
The Ida Nadi on the left hand side,

00:36:08.673 --> 00:36:14.064
nourishes our Subconscious mind,

00:36:14.281 --> 00:36:18.881
fills it and activates it.

00:36:20.481 --> 00:36:24.573
For instance, right now, as you listen to what I
am saying, you are listening to it with your
conscious mind.

00:36:25.015 --> 00:36:29.315
But this thing goes into your subconscious mind.

00:36:29.390 --> 00:36:33.657
This function is performed by the channel on the left side:

00:36:34.490 --> 00:36:38.599
it immediately stores whatever we hear into the subconscious.

00:36:42.124 --> 00:36:45.432
That is why what people call as 'conditioning'

00:36:46.174 --> 00:36:50.499
is of two types – it can be good conditioning
or bad conditioning.

00:36:51.699 --> 00:36:56.257
Now people like Freud saw only harmful conditionings
- his eyes - means these,

00:36:56.765 --> 00:37:00.415
the very way these people acquire knowledge is such

00:37:00.540 --> 00:37:04.723
that it is a dark place, today whoever gets
whatever in his hand, he takes it and sits
with it - this is the Truth.

00:37:06.115 --> 00:37:07.989
What is termed 'objective'.

00:37:09.115 --> 00:37:14.981
The other way is to simply switch on the light so
that everyone can see—this is the Sahaja Yoga method.

00:37:16.481 --> 00:37:22.681
And there is a blind way of acquiring such knowledge
—whether by hearing it from someone, through Science,
or by obtaining it in some other manner.

00:37:24.273 --> 00:37:29.456
So, when the search was conducted in that manner,
Mr. Freud—who was blind, after all...

00:37:29.856 --> 00:37:33.014
And he was somewhat mentally perverse himself, I think—

00:37:33.306 --> 00:37:35.673
what nasty things people say about him

00:37:35.815 --> 00:37:40.173
he caught hold of one of them and worked on that.

00:37:41.548 --> 00:37:45.306
And he started saying that whatever you forbid
someone from doing something this way that

00:37:45.389 --> 00:37:49.831
'Don't do this,' 'Don't do that,' 'Don't do it
this way or that way'—it leads to conditioning.

00:37:51.206 --> 00:37:53.148
It prevents a person from being free.

00:37:53.473 --> 00:37:57.073
But he did not think that if you do not forbid
a person something,

00:37:57.148 --> 00:37:59.381
then the other channel will gain strength.

00:38:00.356 --> 00:38:02.881
The first channel forms the superego within us.

00:38:03.139 --> 00:38:07.539
The first channel, Ida Nadi, it forms superego,
conditioning.

00:38:10.956 --> 00:38:15.539
And the second channel, the nadi of ego

00:38:16.331 --> 00:38:19.206
which is of the right side, forms the ego.

00:38:21.464 --> 00:38:25.731
Meaning, now that you’ve become a government servant,
you don’t even speak civilly to anyone.

00:38:27.739 --> 00:38:32.689
Some people went to meet the minister, so there
a gentleman was jumping around a lot.

00:38:32.764 --> 00:38:36.631
The poor villagers didn't understand. So they
asked, "What is the matter?"

00:38:36.739 --> 00:38:38.523
He said, 'Don't you know that I am PA.'

00:38:38.665 --> 00:38:43.173
The people said, "You should have told earlier that
you’re drunk—why would we be talking to you then?"

00:38:43.990 --> 00:38:47.898
So this increases the ego. Mr. Freud failed to
understand this

00:38:48.023 --> 00:38:52.840
that when you cut away the left side, the other side
rises up, and the ego climbs right over the super-ego.

00:38:53.898 --> 00:38:56.857
The ego and the superego exist within our
heads in this way.

00:38:57.424 --> 00:39:03.857
Now let Me explain ego and super ego a little
because by God's Grace you people are not
from Psychology.

00:39:05.474 --> 00:39:10.090
Psychology also acknowledges this—the ego and superego—

00:39:10.198 --> 00:39:15.190
much like a small child nursing from his mother,
sitting in a state of bliss and contentment.

00:39:15.890 --> 00:39:21.623
After that, when his mother picked him up and
tried to move him to the other side, his ego was
triggered—wondered why had she done that.

00:39:22.806 --> 00:39:27.540
So, his mother scolded him that, "No, son,
don't do like this," then his superego was awakened.

00:39:29.240 --> 00:39:32.915
In this way, balloon-like entities—such as the
ego and superego—

00:39:33.015 --> 00:39:35.799
accumulate in our heads in this manner.

00:39:35.932 --> 00:39:40.924
The ego, from the front up to this point, and
the superego, from the back—in this manner.

00:39:41.724 --> 00:39:47.857
It is only when these two parts fully fuse here
that the fontanelle area of ​​the skull

00:39:48.715 --> 00:39:53.840
becomes completely calcified and firm, and
the palate gets filled up.

00:39:54.165 --> 00:39:59.040
Then it's happened—then you became you, you became
you, you became you—and everything else fell away.

00:40:00.557 --> 00:40:03.823
Everyone became different and each had his own shell.

00:40:04.123 --> 00:40:07.123
Just as eggs have their own shells, humans too
have their own.

00:40:07.706 --> 00:40:11.990
They are created so that a person may fully

00:40:12.148 --> 00:40:16.665
recognize his freedom and make proper use of it.

00:40:19.232 --> 00:40:26.432
After using it, he should understand which thing
is good and which is bad.

00:40:26.907 --> 00:40:32.224
However, it is not left entirely to man; great
saints have incarnated in this world.

00:40:33.507 --> 00:40:38.691
And explained to you that this is 'Dharma'
—don't do this, do that.

00:40:39.316 --> 00:40:40.933
Were all those people crazy?

00:40:42.591 --> 00:40:45.591
We created a separate caste for them and sidelined them.

00:40:45.716 --> 00:40:47.966
Greeting them from morning till evening - work over.

00:40:48.499 --> 00:40:53.683
It is forbidden for us to pay heed to their words
in our lives. After all, why did they say that?

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:05.350
Why did they say that, 'Don't do this, don't do that.'

00:41:05.474 --> 00:41:08.541
'By doing that, this will happen; by doing this,
that will happen.'

00:41:10.449 --> 00:41:15.899
Because, we are so intelligent, aren't we? We will
learn everything through Science.

00:41:18.132 --> 00:41:22.832
What is Science, really? It represents only a very
small fraction of knowledge.

00:41:23.099 --> 00:41:29.949
I will also tell you just how small a fraction of
knowledge you gain through Science—a very small amount.

00:41:31.932 --> 00:41:37.182
The five elements that pass through you through
the Pingala Nadi, from which these five
Mahabhutas(the five great elements) are formed

00:41:37.307 --> 00:41:42.899
—just like knowing that gravity exists within the Earth.

00:41:43.924 --> 00:41:47.049
But why is it? How is it?

00:41:47.665 --> 00:41:52.941
You ask a question that why did we become humans
from amoeba? What is the reason?

00:41:53.091 --> 00:41:58.649
If I am making this then a person will ask,
'Why are You making this?

00:41:59.399 --> 00:42:03.316
After all, there must be some meaning to this.
Why did God create us?

00:42:03.949 --> 00:42:07.825
Today someone from Biology came and said,
"I don't believe in God."

00:42:07.950 --> 00:42:12.258
I said, "I am surprised at you; if someone
from a Biology background doesn't believe it,
then nothing can be said."

00:42:14.658 --> 00:42:18.275
The rest work with inanimate elements, at least
the person who is into Biology

00:42:18.392 --> 00:42:22.475
