of Sahaja Yoga to you.

01:01:22.973 --> 01:01:25.390
Tomorrow, I will explain all its deeper aspects.

01:01:25.590 --> 01:01:29.832
I have said that the subtle, subtler and the subtlest

01:01:31.965 --> 01:01:36.699
knowledge about it, all that I am ready to tell you.

01:01:37.349 --> 01:01:41.224
This alone is true knowledge; everything else
is ignorance.

01:01:41.949 --> 01:01:47.449
Things will move at the flick of your fingers
—but first, get to know yourself.

01:01:49.191 --> 01:01:53.916
You are not even aware of your own strength, and
then you sit there, completely helpless.

01:01:55.099 --> 01:01:59.066
Your motor hasn't started yet; Start the motor
and then you will know.

01:01:59.358 --> 01:02:01.716
You are already doing other things before that.

01:02:04.508 --> 01:02:07.149
This is a small thing, if you understand it ....

01:02:07.199 --> 01:02:14.407
How come you’re sitting separately, son? Are you alright?
Have a seat. Please sit down, sit down.

01:02:17.390 --> 01:02:22.732
So, the first thing is the occurrence of this happening;
the second thing is becoming firmly established within it.

01:02:22.849 --> 01:02:26.857
The third thing is to gain complete knowledge—
to know where each chakra is located.

01:02:26.990 --> 01:02:30.582
How to move that chakra, how to fix it.

01:02:31.724 --> 01:02:37.532
There are just three steps to Sahaja Yoga. Once
they are done, you become a truly accomplished
Sahaja Yogi.

01:02:38.107 --> 01:02:43.407
And sitting right here, perform miracles for yourself
and others and enjoy.

01:02:43.474 --> 01:02:46.257
Because energy will continue to flow from within
you all the time.

01:02:50.115 --> 01:02:56.066
Do you understand? Has everyone grasped it, or are
there still questions lingering in your heads?

01:02:58.724 --> 01:03:03.091
If there are no questions then after this we
will all go into meditation.

01:03:03.191 --> 01:03:07.075
I’ll be back in a minute or two; you all loosen
your belts a bit.

01:03:07.158 --> 01:03:10.733
Take off the tie because there is some catch on
the Vishuddhi Chakra from behind.

01:03:11.275 --> 01:03:16.450
And sit back, feeling completely at ease—just relax;
I am no 'guru' or anything of the sort, I am your Mother.

01:03:17.167 --> 01:03:21.883
You are held in the highest regard by Me, and I
am working hard on you. Just relax your body.

01:03:22.950 --> 01:03:25.616
Yes, socks(UNCLEAR) if you want to, then do it otherwise not.

01:03:25.999 --> 01:03:29.983
If this were something made of nylon or a
similar material— in that the earth element ...
